WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:03.113
♫ Pizza in the morning,
pizza in the evening

00:00:03.115 --> 00:00:05.285
♫ Pizza at suppertime ♫

00:00:08.455 --> 00:00:10.331
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:15.918
- That Little Caesar’s, you know,

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.253
they got a soft spot in my heart

00:00:17.255 --> 00:00:18.755
because they got me through college.

00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:21.381
- I definitely have always hated Dominos.

00:00:21.383 --> 00:00:23.100
- Yeah, I mean, if it’s
there I’m gonna eat it.

00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:25.553
- [Voiceover] Grease, mm!

00:00:25.555 --> 00:00:26.805
- Oh, that’s greasy.

00:00:26.806 --> 00:00:27.763
Which is perfect.

00:00:27.765 --> 00:00:29.140
- That’s the most
important thing, is if you

00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:31.976
can hold it out and it stands on its own.

00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:33.686
- They’ve got some good sauce on here.

00:00:33.688 --> 00:00:35.521
- The crust is pretty bread-y.

00:00:35.523 --> 00:00:37.273
- I know this cheese, I feel like.

00:00:37.275 --> 00:00:38.608
- I think this is Little Caesars.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.453
- I think so too.

00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:40.776
You know how I can tell?

00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:41.820
- How?
- [Guy] The bottom of it.

00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:43.655
- That’s like the pizza you
get in elementary school.

00:00:43.656 --> 00:00:45.906
- I’m gonna, like, be
passed out after this.

00:00:45.908 --> 00:00:47.160
I can tell you that right now.

00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:51.621
- We got a little crumbly,
what I believe is garlic,

00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:52.830
on the crust.

00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:54.540
- This is like a good slice.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:56.416
This is a heavy slice.

00:00:56.418 --> 00:01:00.921
- The cheese is like, hella cheesy!

00:01:00.923 --> 00:01:02.340
- This pizza does not have enough sauce.

00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:04.175
- They went out of their way
to throw some more spices in.

00:01:04.176 --> 00:01:06.385
- I think this is a better
slice of pizza than the first.

00:01:06.386 --> 00:01:07.553
- Mm, for sure.

00:01:07.555 --> 00:01:09.388
- This was like borderline a lunchable,

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:10.681
(laughing)

00:01:10.683 --> 00:01:12.516
and this one is like

00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:14.770
oh man, there is some love put into this.

00:01:16.105 --> 00:01:18.440
- Number three looks like
bullshit is what this is.

00:01:18.441 --> 00:01:19.565
(laughs)

00:01:19.566 --> 00:01:22.568
- This has got different
sizes of pepperoni on it.

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:24.070
- Not enough sauce for me!

00:01:24.071 --> 00:01:25.613
I’m a sauce girl all the way.

00:01:25.615 --> 00:01:26.865
- I think this is pretty good.

00:01:26.866 --> 00:01:28.825
Although it doesn’t
really taste like pizza.

00:01:28.826 --> 00:01:30.660
- This is like pizza
you’d get in an airport.

00:01:30.661 --> 00:01:31.493
(laughs)

00:01:31.495 --> 00:01:33.161
- It’s a little too
boozey, like they’re trying

00:01:33.163 --> 00:01:35.581
to make it a little too fancy for me.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:37.666
- Alright, this one is hands down

00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:39.668
the poorest looking pizza.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:41.838
- This is Pizza Hut.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:42.796
- Are you sure?

00:01:42.798 --> 00:01:44.506
- I am not.

00:01:44.508 --> 00:01:45.633
(laughs)

00:01:45.635 --> 00:01:47.260
- It smells like a play place.

00:01:47.261 --> 00:01:49.095
- It’s got, like, a ditch before the crust

00:01:49.096 --> 00:01:51.388
where the sauce really collects,

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.931
and it’s way too intense.

00:01:52.933 --> 00:01:54.225
- Soft crust.

00:01:54.226 --> 00:01:55.685
Not bad.
- Papa Johns has

00:01:55.686 --> 00:01:57.686
always lacked on the crust.

00:01:57.688 --> 00:02:00.440
Like, their crust is back.

00:02:00.441 --> 00:02:03.235
- Get in my mouth!

00:02:04.445 --> 00:02:05.736
I ain’t waiting for you.

00:02:05.738 --> 00:02:07.280
- You know what, I know this is Pizza Hut

00:02:07.281 --> 00:02:08.323
by the crust.
- Yeah.

00:02:08.324 --> 00:02:09.406
Exactly.

00:02:09.407 --> 00:02:11.366
- Cause Pizza Hut has good crust!

00:02:11.368 --> 00:02:13.953
- This is good, this is,
it’s a little fluffy.

00:02:13.955 --> 00:02:15.621
- It does kind of taste like bread you get

00:02:15.623 --> 00:02:17.581
before your meal at some restaurant,

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:19.625
just with, like, cheese
and pepperonis on top.

00:02:19.626 --> 00:02:20.835
- It just tastes like butter.

00:02:20.836 --> 00:02:22.753
Like butter bread with cheese on top.

00:02:22.755 --> 00:02:24.046
- I’m all about that, so...

00:02:24.048 --> 00:02:25.050
(laughing)

00:02:27.843 --> 00:02:30.136
- I think this one is the best.

00:02:30.138 --> 00:02:31.888
- 100% this one is my favorite.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.515
And I know that it’s Pizza Hut.

00:02:34.516 --> 00:02:36.141
- I think this one was my favorite.

00:02:36.143 --> 00:02:37.560
- I thought this was the best, too.

00:02:37.561 --> 00:02:39.270
But I still think it’s Papa Johns.

00:02:39.271 --> 00:02:41.063
- Dominos. What we think is Dominos.

00:02:41.065 --> 00:02:42.315
- That is my favorite.

00:02:42.316 --> 00:02:43.691
It is so good.

00:02:43.693 --> 00:02:45.401
Dominos, you stepped up your game.

00:02:45.403 --> 00:02:46.945
- [Both] One, two, three.

00:02:46.946 --> 00:02:48.613
(bell rings)
- Yes!

00:02:48.615 --> 00:02:50.573
Dominos.
- Dominos.

00:02:50.575 --> 00:02:51.908
They’re really killing it.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:53.200
- Goddamn, Dominos.

00:02:53.201 --> 00:02:55.745
- I noticed the cheese,
lighter on the sauce,

00:02:55.746 --> 00:02:57.663
but I noticed it; that garlic seasoning.

00:02:57.665 --> 00:02:58.665
Oh.

00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:00.208
- I’m not doing that again.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.210
We’re not getting pizza
again, Little Caesars.

00:03:02.211 --> 00:03:03.670
- Tell me that you care, or I’m leaving.

00:03:03.671 --> 00:03:05.840
- [Both] Pizza pizza!
- Goddamnit, Little Caesar.

